 of children\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Analyses included only children who were in the specified age groups during the entire influenza season\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"was recalculated in this report using U.S. Census denominators to provide comparable groups\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The unweighted average for the eight sites (i.e., average site-specific coverage) was calculated by summing the percentages\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}